Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- The highlighted file had to match a row exactly, so a trailing slash, backslashes or different capitals selected nothing; the path is now read with either slash, without outer slashes and ignoring case.

